  "Weesperflat (pand 0363100012169740, built 1966; nl:Weesperflat). Landmark lane ruling 2026-11-15: large-recipe (modern slab of repeated balconies).",
  "walls[0] the 76 m Weesperstraat face (3DBAG panel 13: surface 37 the 26 m slab, surface 14 the 15 m south end, walls[1]), read from three 25 m segment crops (w01-248s1h40 2025-01-09, w01-248s2h40 2022-10-07, w01-248s3h40L 2024-12-10): pilotis with recessed shopfronts, three storeys of pale solid balcony parapets in front of white-framed window bands, a recessed dark open storey under a deep slab, three more balcony storeys, a plain parapet.",
